    "source": "Good vs. bad apologies by cast member",
    "why": "The chart gives each cast member's good/bad split (for example Lisa Barlow 19%/81%, Jen Shah 50%/50%, Heather Gay 65%/35%) and season count (5 seasons, 3 seasons, and so on), but apologies.csv has no cast-member column and no cast-to-season mapping. Its summaries mention multiple people and also include non-cast members, so the per-member shares and season labels cannot be computed."
  },
  {
    "source": "Total \"sorry\"s by cast member",
    "why": "The files contain no counts of the word \"sorry\" and no cast-member attribution. apologies.csv records apology moments, not utterances of \"sorry\", so the per-cast totals (65, 49, 40, 38, 21, 16, 14, 10, 5, 3) cannot be reproduced."
